	"data": "The Grand System\n\nA living document tracking the original vision and current build status.\nLast updated: 2026-04-08 by Calcifer\n\nWhat It Is\n\nThe Grand System is cithoreal's personal intelligence stack — an interconnected architecture where thoughts don't get lost. It is not a single app or project. It is the operating system that everything else runs on.\n\nAt its core: capture everything → process it into structured knowledge → give it agency to surface what matters → build interfaces to…",
